<tt xmlns="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml" xmlns:ttm="http://www.w3.org/ns/ttml#metadata" xmlns:itunes="http://music.apple.com/lyric-ttml-internal" xmlns:amll="http://www.example.com/ns/amll" itunes:timing="Line" xml:lang="ja"><head><metadata><ttm:agent type="person" xml:id="v1"/><amll:meta key="ncmMusicId" value="2628232563"/><amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1766458514"/><amll:meta key="musicName" value="夏実"/><amll:meta key="artists" value="AKASAKI"/><amll:meta key="album" value="夏実"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithub" value="149807805"/><amll:meta key="ttmlAuthorGithubLogin" value="Ma-hiru"/></metadata></head><body dur="05:07.221"><div begin="00:01.000" end="05:05.907"><p begin="00:01.000" end="00:05.029" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L1">酸っぱい果実に誘われたの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">受到那颗酸涩果实的吸引</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">su 'p pa i ka ji tsu ni sa so wa re ta no</span></p><p begin="00:05.042" end="00:08.754" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L2">ほら君の目がもう揺らいでる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你看 你的眼神开始游移不定</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ho ra ki mi no me ga mo u yu ra i de ru</span></p><p begin="00:08.774" end="00:16.304" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L3">あの八月に奪われたの 君と僕の想いで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你与我之间的这份感情</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a no ha chi ga tsu ni u ba wa re ta no</span></p><p begin="00:45.699" end="00:53.043" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L4">やるせないこの気持ちと 夏に置いてかれた僕<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">伴随如此郁郁寡欢的心绪</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ya ru se na i ko no ki mo chi to</span></p><p begin="00:53.043" end="00:59.277" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L5">君もさ同じ気持ちなのかな<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你是否也有与我相同的心情</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi mo sa o na ji ki mo chi na no ka na</span></p><p begin="01:00.411" end="01:07.877" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L6">凛とし美しく切ない君の身体はさ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你那凛然美丽流露着悲伤的身体</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ri n to shi u tsu ku shi ku se tsu na i ki mi no ka ra da ha sa</span></p><p begin="01:07.989" end="01:14.504" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L7">どこか果実の匂いがしたの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">莫名地散发着果实的香气</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">do ko ka ka ji tsu no ni o i ga shi ta no</span></p><p begin="01:14.930" end="01:18.832" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L8">儚い空気が 僕を押し寄せ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">虚幻的空气朝着我涌来</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ha ka na i ku u ki ga bo ku wo o shi yo se</span></p><p begin="01:18.946" end="01:22.498" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L9">今に耐えれず 君を探した<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无法忍受现状寻觅起你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ma ni ta e re zu ki mi wo sa ga shi ta</span></p><p begin="01:22.597" end="01:26.970" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L10">あるはずもない足跡をたどる先で<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我从悬崖之下一路都在竭力追循</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a ru ha zu mo na i a shi a to wo ta do ru sa ki de</span></p><p begin="01:26.970" end="01:32.538" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L11">僕は崖の下から…<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">追循本不该存在的足迹</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">bo ku ha ga ke no shi ta ka ra</span></p><p begin="01:33.471" end="01:37.236" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L12">酸っぱい果実に誘われたの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">受到那颗酸涩果实的吸引</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">su 'p pa i ka ji tsu ni sa so wa re ta no</span></p><p begin="01:37.370" end="01:41.079" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L13">ほら僕の目に狂いは無くて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你看 我的眼眸仍旧平静</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ho ra bo ku no me ni ku ru i ha na ku te</span></p><p begin="01:41.079" end="01:48.061" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L14">あの八月に奪われたの 君と僕の想いで<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你与我之间的这份感情</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a no ha chi ga tsu ni u ba wa re ta no</span></p><p begin="01:48.213" end="01:55.808" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L15">眩い氷が溶けた狭間で 君の姿も曖昧になる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在耀眼的冰天雪地消融时</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma ba yu i ko o ri ga to ke ta ha za ma de</span></p><p begin="01:55.863" end="01:59.282" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L16">今からそこに僕が行くから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">很快我就会到你身边去</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">i ma ka ra so ko ni bo ku ga i ku ka ra</span></p><p begin="01:59.282" end="02:03.867" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L17">涙を拭いて待っててね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">愿你能擦干泪水等着我</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">na mi da wo fu i te ma 't te te ne</span></p><p begin="02:17.963" end="02:25.253" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L18">君はさわざとらしい笑顔をする人だね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你啊</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi ha sa</span></p><p begin="02:25.333" end="02:31.500" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L19">その顔 瞳が僕をえぐるの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">那张脸 与双眸都在刺痛我</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so no ka o hi to mi ga bo ku wo e gu ru no</span></p><p begin="02:32.447" end="02:36.298" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L20">あの日の街路樹 キスをかわした<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我们曾在那天的林荫树下亲吻</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a no hi no ga i ro ju ki su wo ka wa shi ta</span></p><p begin="02:36.463" end="02:40.067" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L21">辛さと共に涙した君<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">伴随那份艰辛落泪的你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">tsu ra sa to to mo ni na mi da shi ta ki mi</span></p><p begin="02:40.148" end="02:43.791" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L22">こぼれる記憶 熟れた愛すらも<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让记忆一涌而出 就连已然成熟的爱</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ko bo re ru ki o ku u re ta a i su ra mo</span></p><p begin="02:43.791" end="02:47.268" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L23">君の元へ運ぶから<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">也将我带至你的身旁</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ki mi no mo to he ha ko bu ka ra</span></p><p begin="02:47.268" end="02:51.103" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L24">酸っぱい果実に誘われたの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">受到那颗酸涩果实的吸引</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">su 'p pa i ka ji tsu ni sa so wa re ta no</span></p><p begin="02:51.220" end="02:54.870" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L25">ほら君の目に狂いは無くて<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你看 你的眼眸仍旧平静</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ho ra ki mi no me ni ku ru i ha na ku te</span></p><p begin="02:54.935" end="03:01.884" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L26">僕を優しく包み込むから迷いなんてなかったよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">如此温柔地凝视着我</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">bo ku wo ya sa shi ku tsu tsu mi ko mu ka ra</span></p><p begin="03:02.036" end="03:09.703" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L27">眩い氷が溶けた狭間で 僕の姿が君と重なる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在耀眼的冰天雪地消融时</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma ba yu i ko o ri ga to ke ta ha za ma de</span></p><p begin="03:09.703" end="03:13.559" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28">不意に現れ 君を抱き寄せたら<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">若是我突然出现 将你拥入怀里</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">fu i ni a ra wa re ki mi wo da ki yo se ta ra</span></p><p begin="03:13.559" end="03:17.715" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29">あぁ なんて言うのかな<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">啊啊 届时我该说些什么</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">a na n te i u no ka na</span></p><p begin="03:17.715" end="03:21.466" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30">見えないけど消えない君<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">虽然看不到但你并未消失</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi e na i ke do ki e na i ki mi</span></p><p begin="03:21.466" end="03:25.013" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31">巡り巡る過去の話<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">过去的故事循环往复</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">me gu ri me gu ru ka ko no ha na shi</span></p><p begin="03:25.147" end="03:28.680" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L32">手のひらからこぼれ堕ちる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">都从我的掌心之中就此滑落</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">te no hi ra ka ra ko bo re o chi ru</span></p><p begin="03:28.813" end="03:32.429" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L33">匂いだけが脳を巡る…<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">唯有那阵气息萦绕脑海</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ni o i da ke ga no u wo me gu ru</span></p><p begin="03:32.498" end="03:36.184" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L34">見えないけど消えない君<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">虽然看不到但你并未消失</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi e na i ke do ki e na i ki mi</span></p><p begin="03:36.184" end="03:39.933" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L35">巡り巡る過去の話<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">过去的故事循环往复</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">me gu ri me gu ru ka ko no ha na shi</span></p><p begin="03:39.933" end="03:43.582" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L36">手のひらからこぼれ堕ちる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">都从我的掌心之中就此滑落</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">te no hi ra ka ra ko bo re o chi ru</span></p><p begin="03:43.616" end="03:47.333" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L37">匂いだけが脳を巡る…<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">唯有那阵气息萦绕脑海</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ni o i da ke ga no u wo me gu ru</span></p><p begin="03:46.597" end="03:49.514" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L38">手持ち無沙汰の唾液が<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我感到如此百无聊赖</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">te mo chi bu sa ta no da e ki ga</span></p><p begin="03:50.976" end="03:54.810" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L39">酸っぱい匂いの先に君は<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">在那阵酸涩的气息尽头</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">su 'p pa i ni o i no sa ki ni ki mi ha</span></p><p begin="03:54.927" end="03:58.858" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L40">うずくまりつつ僕を誘う様に<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">有你蜷缩的身影似在将我邀请</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">u zu ku ma ri tsu tsu bo ku wo sa so u yo u ni</span></p><p begin="03:58.858" end="04:02.127" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L41">僕をエグり捕まえたの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">刺痛了我将我就此捕获</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">bo ku wo e gu ri tsu ka ma e ta no</span></p><p begin="04:02.260" end="04:05.440" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L42">まだ生きてるかの様に<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">感觉就像你还在人世般</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ma da i ki te ru ka no yo u ni</span></p><p begin="04:05.468" end="04:07.719" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L43">すぐそこに見えたよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">立马就出现在我眼前 然后就这样</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">su gu so ko ni mi e ta yo ho ra so no ma ma</span></p><p begin="04:07.799" end="04:13.383" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L44">ほらそのまま僕の手を取り引き寄せてくれ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">牵起我的手 拉我向你靠近</span></p><p begin="04:13.412" end="04:18.687" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L45">久しぶりだね もう二度と逢えないと思ったよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">好久不见了呢</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi sa shi bu ri da ne</span></p><p begin="04:18.687" end="04:20.435" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L46">ごめんね<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">对不起</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">go me n ne</span></p><p begin="04:20.465" end="04:24.332" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L47">酸っぱい果実に誘われたの<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">受到那颗酸涩果实的吸引</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">su 'p pa i ka ji tsu ni sa so wa re ta no</span></p><p begin="04:24.481" end="04:27.886" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L48">ほら僕達はもう揺らいでる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你看 我们都已有所动摇</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ho ra bo ku ta chi ha mo u yu ra i de ru</span></p><p begin="04:27.886" end="04:36.172" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L49">空に舞いながら 頭を巡る君と僕の思い出<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">飞舞在天空的同时你与我的回忆</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">so ra ni ma i na ga ra a ta ma wo me gu ru</span></p><p begin="04:36.172" end="04:39.807" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L50">見えないけど消えない君<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">虽然看不到但你并未消失</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi e na i ke do ki e na i ki mi</span></p><p begin="04:39.924" end="04:43.572" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L51">巡り巡る過去の話<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">过去的故事循环往复</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">me gu ri me gu ru ka ko no ha na shi</span></p><p begin="04:43.572" end="04:47.274" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L52">手のひらからこぼれ落ちる<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">都从我的掌心之中就此滑落</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">te no hi ra ka ra ko bo re o chi ru</span></p><p begin="04:47.391" end="04:50.941" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L53">匂いだけが脳をめぐる…<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">唯有那阵气息萦绕脑海</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">ni o i da ke ga no u wo me gu ru</span></p><p begin="04:50.991" end="04:54.640" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L54">見えないけど消えない君<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">虽然看不到但你并未消失</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">mi e na i ke do ki e na i ki mi</span></p><p begin="04:54.658" end="04:58.302" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L55">巡り巡る過去の話<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">过去的故事循环往复</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">me gu ri me gu ru ka ko no ha na shi</span></p><p begin="04:58.306" end="05:02.039" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L56">手のひらから堕ちぬ様に<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">似要从我的掌心之中滑落</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">te no hi ra ka ra o chi nu yo u ni</span></p><p begin="05:02.039" end="05:05.907" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L57">光の中君を愛すよ<span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">深爱着光芒之中的你</span><span ttm:role="x-roman" xml:lang="ja-Latn">hi ka ri no na ka ki mi wo a i su yo</span></p></div></body></tt>